/* CSS3 ga kirish: Inline, Internal va External CSS ulash */
/* TODO: CSS3 ga kirish: Inline, Internal va External CSS ulash bo'yicha CSS stillarini yozing */

.container {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

questions.question:
Quyidagi kod fragmentiga e'tibor bering:
```css
.card-container {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
}
```
Ushbu kod qismida 'CSS3 ga kirish: Inline, Internal va External CSS ulash' ning qaysi xususiyati aks etgan?

Quyidagi koddagi bajarilish natijasi yoki xatti-harakati qanday bo'ladi?
```css
.grid-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 24px;
}
```

Quyidagi kod snippetidagi mavjud sintaktik yoki mantiqiy xatoni aniqlang:
```css
/* Bug hunt */
.btn:hover {
  background-color: #2563eb;
  opacity: 0.9;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
```

'CSS3 ga kirish: Inline, Internal va External CSS ulash' mavzusiga oid ushbu kod bo'lagining asosiy amaliy maqsadi nima?
```css
@media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
  .sidebar {
    display: block;
    width: 300px;
  }
}
```

Siz real loyihada 'CSS3 ga kirish: Inline, Internal va External CSS ulash' bo'yicha topshiriq bajarmoqdasiz. Quyidagi koddagi xavfsizlik yoki performance kamchiligini to'g'rilang:
```css
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}
```

