```jsx
function UserProfile({ user }) {
  const [isFollowed, setIsFollowed] = useState(false);
  return (
    <button onClick={() => setIsFollowed(!isFollowed)}>
      {isFollowed ? 'Followed' : 'Follow'}
    </button>
  );
}
```
Ushbu kod qismida 'State tushunchasi va useState hook'idan foydalanish' ning qaysi xususiyati aks etgan?

Quyidagi koddagi bajarilish natijasi yoki xatti-harakati qanday bo'ladi?
```jsx
useEffect(() => {
  const timer = setInterval(() => console.log('Tick'), 1000);
  return () => clearInterval(timer);
}, []);
```

Quyidagi kod snippetidagi mavjud sintaktik yoki mantiqiy xatoni aniqlang:
```jsx
// Missing Key Prop Warning
const list = products.map(p => <li key={p.id}>{p.name}</li>);
```

'State tushunchasi va useState hook'idan foydalanish' mavzusiga oid ushbu kod bo'lagining asosiy amaliy maqsadi nima?
```jsx
const memoizedValue = useMemo(() => {
  return computeExpensiveData(data);
}, [data]);
```

Siz real loyihada 'State tushunchasi va useState hook'idan foydalanish' bo'yicha topshiriq bajarmoqdasiz. Quyidagi koddagi xavfsizlik yoki performance kamchiligini to'g'rilang:
```jsx
const { id } = useParams();
const { data, isLoading } = useQuery(['user', id], () => fetchUser(id));
```

